CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791309252
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAsos confirms hackers sent
OL,4,A'unauthorised' notification to app
OL,5,Ausers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe notification was addressed to the
OL,8,Fcompany's data protection officer and
OL,9,FIT teams in what cyber security experts
OL,10,Fsaid looked like a "brazen" extortion
OL,11,Fattempt.
OL,13,FAsos acknowledged the "unauthorised
OL,14,Fcustomer notification" on Tuesday
OL,15,Fafternoon, saying some "basic personal
OL,16,Finformation" may have been accessed.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
