OL,3,AFinland orders halt to work on two
OL,4,AGoogle data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinnish authorities have ordered a halt
OL,7,Fto building work at two planned Google
OL,8,Fdata centres amid concerns over the
OL,9,Fclearance of more than 300 hectares of
OL,10,Fforest.
OL,12,FThe sites form part of Google's record
OL,13,FbB,13bn (#11bn; $15bn) investment in
OL,14,FFinland, announced less than a month
OL,15,Fago and described by the company as its
OL,16,Flargest single investment in Europe.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791309252
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AFinland orders halt to work on two
OL,4,AGoogle data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finnish Supervisory Agency (LVV)
OL,7,Fsaid work at one site was carried out
OL,8,Fwithout a mandatory environmental
OL,9,Fimpact assessment and ordered measures
OL,10,Fthat would "significantly alter the
OL,11,Fenvironment" to be suspended by 23
OL,12,FOctober.
OL,14,FGoogle said it had "fallen short of our
OL,15,Fown high standards in this instance"
OL,16,Fand would follow the agency's guidance.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
