OL,3,AQueen pays tribute to 'irrepressible'
OL,4,AJeffrey Archer
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen Camilla has paid tribute to the
OL,7,Fbestselling author and former
OL,8,Fpolitician Jeffrey Archer, who has died
OL,9,Fat the age of 86.
OL,11,F"Seldom does an author get to live a
OL,12,Flife as rich, varied and colourful as
OL,13,Fany of the characters in their books,
OL,14,For with as many surprising plot
OL,15,Ftwists," the Queen said in a statement.
OL,17,FShe added that Archer was "not without
OL,18,Fflaw", but that "friends will recall
OL,19,Fhim as an irrepressible life force
OL,20,Fthrough all the many differing chapters
OL,21,Fof his life".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
